$$\n\nComparing the above to our given equation\n\n$$\n\\frac{x-4}{3}=\\frac{y-7}{-1}=\\frac{z-(-6)}{-7},\n$$\n\nwe find that our line passes through the point $P(4,7,-6)$ and is parallel to $v=⟨3,-1,-7⟩.$ Therefore, its vector equation is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r & =p+tv \\\\ r & =[\\begin{aligned}4 \\\\ 7 \\\\ -6\\end{aligned}]+t[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ -1 \\\\ -7\\end{aligned}],\\,t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14042625/state.json" "file_sha256" "570dda02acd57c60b6e215edeae92ca8ed4b949c6322d76e5af575968de3ade1"} {"question" "q-127069" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14042625/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "080ba4d1769da3809cbf2ab4e44f58784d7dd89caeba612e18774fa2b95f178e"} {"question" "q-127069" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14042625/state.json" "file_sha256" "570dda02acd57c60b6e215edeae92ca8ed4b949c6322d76e5af575968de3ade1"} {"question" "q-127069" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "r=[\\begin{aligned}4 \\\\ 6 \\\\ 7\\end{aligned}]+t[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ -7 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}],\\,t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] ["math" "r=[\\begin{aligned}4 \\\\ 7 \\\\ -6\\end{aligned}]+t[\\begin{aligned}-7 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}],\\,t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] ["math" "r=[\\begin{aligned}4 \\\\ 7 \\\\ -6\\end{aligned}]+t[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ -1 \\\\ -7\\end{aligned}],\\,t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] ["math" "r=[\\begin{aligned}4 \\\\ 7 \\\\ 6\\end{aligned}]+t[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 7\\end{aligned}],\\,t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] ["text" "None o